l Maykov","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9xefUeeVpFhaBLZwYqrNQfnEsYi.jpg"},{"id":2009497,"name":"Vladimir Afanasyev","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/k5QXusxIBkN81CPhzNn4CTJ0nfH.jpg"},{"id":1090942,"name":"Petr Yandane","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fDe3Dd1W6GrgnGIdfT1ONqJIbpn.jpg"},{"id":97336,"name":"Evgeny Koryakovsky","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5DA0pUsadg5xtdkeYeIPYzoH9sI.jpg"},{"id":588064,"name":"Yuri Berkun","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4TxjWxRCfzzibJplJDP8zjhJuaz.jpg"},{"id":1972451,"name":"Evgeny Danchevsky","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gGPaQriFLUp9YR4ktllHbhnd7Ur.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Frontiere selvagge","overview":"Durante il regno di Pietro I, un periodo fatto di invasioni e sanguinose guerre, il giovane ufficiale Ivan Demarin viene inviato, su volere dello zar, ai confini della Siberia, nella città di Tobolsk. Qui, insieme al suo reggimento, si ritroverà a dover affrontare una cospirazione a opera di alcuni principi che vogliono impossessarsi dell’oro dello Yarkand","tagline":"L'ascesa di un impero"},{"language":"en-US","title":"The Conquest of Siberia","overview":"Ivan Demarin, a young officer of Peter the First’s new guards, follows the Tsar’s order and goes to the frontier town of Tobolsk, deep in the Siberian forest. There Ivan falls in love for the first time and he and his regiment happen to be involved in conspiracy of local princes who hunt for gold in the town of Yarkand. His fort is surrounded by hordes of wild Dzungars and there is no one to call for help…","tagline":"The Hottest Wintertime"},{"language":"ru-RU","overview":"Молодой офицер новой гвардии Петра I Иван Демарин по заданию царя отправляется в глубину Сибири - в пограничный Тобольск. Здесь Иван встречает свою первую любовь и вместе со своим полком оказывается втянутым в заговор местных князей, охотящихся за золотом Яркенда. Его крепость окружена полчищами диких джунгар и помощи ждать неоткуда...","tagline":"Много званых, мало избранных"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oSSvHwbYp8zk09wuzG0QiM0oamD.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/do4EhaEcFyxlu3j7wE1UOiX1B38.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":520552,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"ru-RU","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oSSvHwbYp8zk09wuzG0QiM0oamD.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oSSvHwbYp8zk09wuzG0QiM0oamD.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oSSvHwbYp8zk09wuzG0QiM0oamD.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oSSvHwbYp8zk09wuzG0QiM0oamD.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7D1uPIaPu25xx9KxmdmKsh0eXY2.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7D1uPIaPu25xx9KxmdmKsh0eXY2.jpg","language":"en","width":1500,"height":2250},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7D1uPIaPu25xx9KxmdmKsh0eXY2.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7D1uPIaPu25xx9KxmdmKsh0eXY2.jpg","language":"en","width":1500,"height":2250},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hH6uE66FA1UNbHkTgqFf20gBmI8.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hH6uE66FA1UNbHkTgqFf20gBmI8.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":2857},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/69wsaJNYvWgd29kIW0VYE6ywzMc.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/69wsaJNYvWgd29kIW0VYE6ywzMc.jpg","language":"en","width":600,"height":900},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nIWwasyMmwmGdEuAffDnv